key codes
  the arrows: 3 4 1 2
  space, Enter, Escape: 5 6 7
  a and A are the same key: 97 97
  keys without a code: 0 0 0
a key goes down: pressed during the first step only, held until it comes up
  step 1: held pressed
  step 2: held
  step 3, after an auto-repeat: held
  step 4, after it came up: released
  step 5: nothing
a tap that is over before the step still counts as a press
  the step after the tap: pressed released
  the step after that: nothing
a key without a code is never recorded
  key-none: nothing
clearing forgets held keys
  left: nothing
  a: nothing
sounds wait in a list until the game loop plays them
  waiting: 2
  the second: wave 1, from 300 to 60 hertz, 400 ms
  after clearing: 0
  of 40 tones in one frame, kept: 16
